==Behind the scenes==
Enza Rylanz was created for the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]''.<ref name="Getty" /> The character was first revealed in an image released by the [[Wikipedia:Empire (magazine)|''Empire'']] magazine<ref name="Empire 2025 Preview">{{BookCite|author=Ryan, Mike|container=Andor Season 2|title=[[Wikipedia:Empire (magazine)|''Empire'']]|number=January 2025|publisher=[[Wikipedia:Bauer Media Group|Bauer Media Group]]|date=2024-11-21|pages=pp. 49-53}}</ref> and was portrayed by [[Alaïs Lawson]].<ref name="Getty" />

